# Normalize line endings across Windows <-> Unix clones. Text files are stored
# with LF in git; .env/.json/.yaml stay byte-clean (no CRLF surprises for the
# dotenv/ffmpeg/json readers). PowerShell scripts keep CRLF if any are added.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.mp4 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.png binary
*.mov binary
